  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "plot-advancement",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/22/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ねがいぼしが　くみこまれており\nパワースポットに　いると　ひかりだして\nポケモンを　ダイマックス　させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "소원의별이 박혀 있으며\n파워스폿에 있으면 빛이 나고\n포켓몬을 다이맥스시킬 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "嵌入了許願星，\n當位處能量點時會發光，\n讓寶可夢極巨化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quand elle se trouve près d’une Source d’Énergie,\nl’Étoile Vœu sertie dans ce poignet brille, ce qui\npermet de donner à un Pokémon sa forme Dynamax.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wenn man sich in der Nähe einer Energiequelle aufhält,\nleuchtet der darin eingearbeitete Wunschstern auf und\nermöglicht die Dynamaximierung von Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si lleva engarzada una Estrella Deseo y el portador se\nhalla junto a un nodo energético, reacciona emitiendo\nuna luz y permite dinamaxizar Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Contiene una Desiostella e quando si trova vicino\na un punto energetico emette una luce che permette\nai Pokémon di dynamaxizzarsi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Wishing Star has been affixed to it. It lets out a light\nthat allows Pokémon to Dynamax when at a Power Spot.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ねがいぼしが　組みこまれており\nパワースポットに　いると　光りだして\nポケモンを　ダイマックス　させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "内部嵌入了许愿星，\n在能量点就会发出光芒，\n使宝可梦极巨化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si lleva engarzada una Estrella Deseo y el portador se\nhalla junto a un nodo energético, reacciona emitiendo\nuna luz y permite dinamaxizar Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
